sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as View models
    participant RC as RefreshCoordinator
    participant SE as Secure Enclave
    participant KC as Keychain
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant GW as REST API Gateway
    UI->>RC: accessToken() for a request
    alt token N has over 25 percent of its life left
        RC-->>UI: token N from memory
    else expiring or expired
        RC->>RC: start or join the single in-flight refresh
        RC->>KC: read refresh token
        RC->>SE: sign DPoP proof for POST /token
        RC->>AS: refresh_token grant with DPoP proof
        alt 200
            AS-->>RC: token N2 and rotated refresh token
            RC->>KC: replace refresh token before anything else
            RC-->>UI: token N2 to every waiter
        else invalid_grant
            AS-->>RC: invalid_grant
            RC->>KC: delete refresh token
            RC-->>UI: signed out, show sign-in
        else network failure
            RC-->>UI: offline error, keep refresh token
            Note over RC: retry later. Never sign out on a transport error.
        end
    end
    UI->>SE: sign DPoP proof for this request
    UI->>GW: request with DPoP token and proof
    GW-->>UI: response, or 401 with DPoP-Nonce to retry once
